# wc1 (2026-10-30 night): causal profiling in the world at HOME (unprofiled). commitdelay 20: +20 us per commit
# (~2,870 commits per frame = +57 ms per frame); q0delay 20: +20 us per queue-0 draw or dispatch packet (~4,260 per
# frame = +85 ms per frame). The frame-time change per added millisecond is the thread's critical-path share.
base-0 100
cd20-1 100 commitdelay 20
q0d20-1 100 q0delay 20
base-1 100
cd20-2 100 commitdelay 20
q0d20-2 100 q0delay 20
base-2 100
